# The vendor defconfig enables BTF, but the Buildroot kernel fixup requires
# host-pahole for it. Disable BTF for the first bring-up; it can be enabled
# later together with BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_NEEDS_HOST_PAHOLE=y.
# CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF is not set
# The vendor tree contains warnings rejected by the newer Buildroot toolchain.
# Keep them as warnings, matching the original SDK build behaviour.
# CONFIG_WERROR is not set
